homelab-agent (0.1.8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ship a fleet-trust nftables baseline drop-in
    (/etc/nftables.d/10-homelab-fleet-trust.nft). Accepts all intra-fleet
    traffic on the three private planes (service 10.50.0.0/22, storage
    10.45.0.0/16, mgmt 10.20.0.0/16) in both the base input and output
    chains, so homelab-* services no longer need per-port host-firewall
    rules to reach each other. Perimeter stays at the edge CTs + the
    bad-ips table (a separate prerouting hook, untouched). Applied live
    without flushing the ruleset (bad-ips' runtime set survives) and at
    boot via the /etc/nftables.d include.

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Fri, 09 Oct 2026 23:27:00 -0500

