homelab-agent (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Per-host fleet agent: declarative
    /etc/homelab/services/*.yml manifest checked against reality,
    reported to homelab-api via heartbeat (push) and GET /status
    (pull, authenticated). Replaces api.infrastructure_registry/
    `homelab-cli topology`.

